# body

Intended path docs/x.md -> md mode. Exact-pair regression control: the marker
whitelists `[publisher: NOAA]` but the actual field is `publisher: CalGEM`. The
exact-pair compare requires field AND value to match -> (publisher,CalGEM) is not
in the allow set {(publisher,NOAA)} -> BLOCK. A stale or mismatched marker is NOT
a blanket allow; only the EXACT pair is suppressed.
